  <item>
    <title>EP.07 我破防了，因为这些后知后觉的事儿</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d559014a0f950f84e2c3fa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d559014a0f950f84e2c3fa</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Sep 2024 06:19:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🐑 &nbsp;🐱</span></p><span></span><p><span>✌️我们开了新的栏目，🐱故事会！🎉</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期我们聊聊那些“后知后觉”的经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>回顾了过往的许多事情，当初的我们也许是无知，或是迟钝，我们曾在过去的经历里迷茫过、挣扎过、也在记忆里反复自我怀疑过。所幸，时间把这些情绪都带走了，终于我们可以开着玩笑把这些过往一一讲出来，大家听个乐呵吧～😉</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝愿大家都少一些后知后觉，虽然有些猫依然在经历🤪（哪只猫我不说</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✍️Shownotes：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a> 🤗温柔的家教男老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="307">05:07</a> 😱电话吧的店主大叔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="579">09:39</a> 😳不愿意表露内心的发小</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a> 🙃「看不起我」的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1131">18:51</a> 🧐消失的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1519">25:19</a> ☹️她没有选择站在我身边</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1783">29:43</a> 😝关于男生的刻板印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1945">32:25</a> 🤥90年代的骗局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2229">37:09</a> 🔮玄学上的「外应」</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>HERO-Family of the Year</span></p><span></span><p><span>夜照亮了夜-万芳</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️联系我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微博@CYDOOR备忘录</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐱@写信给东霓</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙｜QQ音乐｜网易云音乐｜苹果播客｜荔枝fm｜蜻蜓FM｜喜马拉雅</span></p>]]></description>
