  <item>
    <title>EP.04 和玄学博主的礼物故事会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666d9380c26e396a36fe3cb2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666d9380c26e396a36fe3cb2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Jun 2024 13:13:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这次有位新朋友，请让我们亲切的称呼她为“小猫”~</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家鼓掌👏👏👏</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为私下里我们聊了太多关于【送礼】与【收礼】的事情，有探讨也有吐槽（显然吐槽比较多...），所以我们决定干脆做一期关于“礼物”的故事会，跟大家一起聊聊，独乐乐不如众乐乐~</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家喜欢~</span></p><span></span><p><span>小猫是位玄学博主，所以可能有提到一些生僻的词汇，大家有兴趣可以自己查查~</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>大运、喜用（神）、财人、八字互旺</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>✍shownotes</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> &nbsp;父亲节，爸爸的礼物被截胡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">06:37</a> 送好朋友的昂贵的礼物却被认为是显摆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="796">13:16</a> 互送礼物一定要等价吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">16:18</a> 朋友送了我一个fake做回礼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1443">24:03</a> 奇怪的礼物们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a> 送礼小tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2813">46:53</a> 礼物里的五行元素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2979">49:39</a> 送礼收礼时的沟通</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>🎵BGM</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>HERO-Family of the Year</span></p><span></span><p><span>三个心愿-F.I.R</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>微博@CYDOOR备忘录</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljxIkYItyp5kdKbkcLjV3aVXL_Mg.m4a" length="57780900" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:40</itunes:duration>
