  <item>
    <title>EP.03 我的心里住着什么样的“恶魔”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662faa6bf3ee6d4f8a9b68ba</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662faa6bf3ee6d4f8a9b68ba</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Apr 2024 14:10:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>偶然的一次发现自己内心其实也没那么“干净”，总有那么一些阴暗的东西会悄悄滋生。但，好像也不是所有的阴暗面都需要被“克服”，与它平和共处，也不是不行。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以有了这一期的内容，让我们一起聊聊自己内心的小恶魔。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔖时间导引</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:22</a> 恶魔是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="149">02:29</a> 很不容易发觉的“傲慢”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="481">08:01</a> 傲慢的内化是攀比和虚荣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="737">12:17</a> “知行合一”也能带来自洽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="944">15:44</a> “偏见”也会有分类？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1304">21:44</a> 关于“嫉妒”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1696">28:16</a> 对抗嫉妒有很多种方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1902">31:42</a> 嫉妒会滋生攻击性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2053">34:13</a> 最让我们“脚趾扣地”的是“交浅言深”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2705">45:05</a> “报复”的情绪，或许是行动的动力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2830">47:10</a> 似乎所有的不平和都有一个共同的原因</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵BGM</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Love is - Rod Steward</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>微博</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>@CYDOOR备忘录</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljNQCEmj45DzsmekIkzus_ye7l9K.m4a" length="54988649" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoTo16ARo9OhlbkDil-HLl8F4DGo.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP.02 你的春节我的春节，好像都一样？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e0292fda891a9cd9a2d6c6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e0292fda891a9cd9a2d6c6</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Feb 2024 06:50:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期诞生在咖啡厅的内容，过完年后的我们约在一起，就像平时聊天一样展开了这一期的内容，没有太多的草稿，全凭想到什么说什么，希望你能喜欢并加入我们的讨论～</span></p><p><span>更希望你能有不同的过年体验，分享给我们！</span></p><p><strong><span>🔖时间导引</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 过年这些天我们都做了些什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="259">04:19</a> 关于春晚我们的一点小疑问</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 过年回家的大家，真的开心吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a> 为什么过年开始让我们觉得无聊了？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1102">18:22</a> 过年绕不开的催婚和催生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1911">31:51</a> 家似乎不是避风港</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2639">43:59</a> 荔枝羊的相亲经历</span></p><p><strong><span>🎵BGM</span></strong></p><p><span>LAST-鹭卓</span></p><p><span>小美满-周深</span></p><p><strong><span>微博</span></strong></p><p><span>CYDOOR备忘录</span></p>]]></description>
